        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New VR Movie-Watching Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/0f2e974b00baa0abc9a5c4344f564fea.avif?t=1787939074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer co-op: Build a cinema together with friends.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR and non-VR players can join the same session — non-VR players enter as drones, offering a distinct control scheme and perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online videos now support automatic parsing of Bilibili and YouTube — just copy the website URL to play the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch movies together with friends in real time via synchronized online streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports full character customization, allowing you to create your own unique virtual avatar through intuitive, one-click adjustments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New VR Movie-Watching Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/0f2e974b00baa0abc9a5c4344f564fea.avif?t=1787939074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer co-op: Build a cinema together with friends.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR and non-VR players can join the same session — non-VR players enter as drones, offering a distinct control scheme and perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online videos now support automatic parsing of Bilibili and YouTube — just copy the website URL to play the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch movies together with friends in real time via synchronized online streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports full character customization, allowing you to create your own unique virtual avatar through intuitive, one-click adjustments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.poster.avif?t=1787939074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.webm?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.mp4?t=1787939074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "CinemaLandVR is a VR game designed for immersive cinematic experiences. The game provides pre-built architectural modules and furniture. You can construct your own cozy cabin in a natural environment, invite friends to join, collaborate on building, and enjoy synchronized video viewing together.",
